{"3833610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Totally Fair Boxing", "steam_appid": 3833610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyone’s cheating. Except you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ring against a cast of absurd, rule-breaking fighters in this fast-paced boxing boss rush. Ninja with a sword? Check. Guy with a pet dragon? Absolutely. Cyborgs? You bet. Everyone’s bringing something illegal, but not you though. You're here to win clean my dude!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unique opponent will require you to learn patterns and react fast, but you won't be able to win through reaction time alone. No... These fights play out like real-time puzzles with their own mind games at play! Stay sharp!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>learn their moves and strike back</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/d25c1f870159815d26d8c69470fae713.poster.avif?t=1758916051\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/d25c1f870159815d26d8c69470fae713.webm?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/d25c1f870159815d26d8c69470fae713.mp4?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/0982e77e7377b84e02cc0a97bdb6a1a4.poster.avif?t=1758916051\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/0982e77e7377b84e02cc0a97bdb6a1a4.webm?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/0982e77e7377b84e02cc0a97bdb6a1a4.mp4?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rematch mode</strong> - Every opponent has a harder version with new moves and mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/460979ba0afe1bd227d0e4cf8f2b04d7.poster.avif?t=1758916051\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/460979ba0afe1bd227d0e4cf8f2b04d7.webm?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/460979ba0afe1bd227d0e4cf8f2b04d7.mp4?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 17 fights!</strong> - can you beat them all?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New free movement mechanic </strong>– some of the opponent's moves will require you to briefly move around the stage! No more skipping out on leg day, staying in the middle of the ring the entire match. move kid, move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/8045b93a1c21f538422778898dbac790.poster.avif?t=1758916051\" width=454 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/8045b93a1c21f538422778898dbac790.webm?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833610/extras/8045b93a1c21f538422778898dbac790.mp4?t=1758916051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full voice acting</strong> -<strong> </strong>Every opponent has their own unique fight theme and voice actor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Stamina system</strong> - Dodge too much, too early; and you’ll tire out. Time everything carefully! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> - After finishing the main game mode, <strong>endless mode</strong> introduces no health refill between fights. How many opponents can you take out on limited health? compete for the best score on the leader boards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong> - Beat opponents under specific time limits, take zero damage or complete unique objectives for achievements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to your wishlist so you don’t miss the launch!</strong> </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Everyone’s cheating. Except you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the ring against a cast of absurd, rule-breaking fighters in this fast-paced boxing boss rush. Ninja with a sword? Check. Guy with a pet dragon? Absolutely. Cyborgs? You bet. Everyone’s bringing something illegal, but not you though. You're here to win clean my dude!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unique opponent will require you to learn patterns and react fast, but you won't be able to win through reaction time alone. No... These fights play out like real-time puzzles with their own mind games at play! Stay sharp!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>learn their moves and strike back</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl